                    text = "Boars eat meat, fish, bread, cheese, fruit, and mushrooms. In short, nearly everything I’d planned to eat myself. Keep an eye on your companion’s happiness and loyalty; food that is too weak for its level will please it less. Ale is not on the list, a fact for which my provisions are grateful.",
